{"id": "1530446464826736902", "channel_id": "1530178712190845098", "author_id": "226712158845665281", "author_name": "zawaito", "content": "Hey, important question about divine chaos.\n\nIn the description it says it doesnt trigger the othe realm's pure realm feature...\nBut does it still trigger chaos symbiosis?\nFor example, if i exalt GLotan in Caro, will i still gain the embro fusion from the exalt? Or is that also deactivated?", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T05:27:51.535000+00:00", "thread_id": "1530178712190845098"}
